# Preset ladder (A–E in scope)

| Preset | Name |
|--------|------|
| **A** | Highlight reel — STT → top-N → crossfade → LUFS → **mandatory DSP polish** |
| **B** | Chapter podcast — A + chapter metadata |
| **C** | Director's cut — timeboxed selection + diversity |
| **D** | Nonlinear story — graph EDL, flashbacks |
| **E** | **Room and breath polish** — denoise, de-reverb, room-tone bridges (also runs inside A; standalone `run_preset_e.py` re-polishes) |

**F–K** (Bilingual, S2S, custom ranker, YOLO, Wav2Vec, full dub) exist in docs but are **out of scope** for the A–E tooling plan unless explicitly requested.

Implementation order: ship **A** on the linear backbone first (DSP included in the same run); **B–D** add metadata/graph on the same path; **E** can re-run polish on a **single timeline** after cuts are known.
